  "dry_snp_activity": "Berge Bulk acquired the VLOC “NSU Inspire” - 251K/2011 Namura for USD 37 mills. The Post- Panamax “Alcmene” - 93K/2010 YZJ was sold for USD 11.9 mills to Greek buyers. The Ultramax “Isabelle M” - 64K/2024 Imabari was sold for USD 41 mills to clients of Belships. Finally, the Handysize “Liberty C” - 33K/2012 Jiangsu Zhenjiang found new owners for USD 9.2 mills.",
